            "name": "total_duration_ms",
            "type": "sum",
            "col": "payload.duration_ms"
          }
        ]
      },
      "description": "event_type 分組不分大小寫，輸出分組鍵以 lower 呈現，並與重算的各類型計數與加總一致。",
